@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Complaint Management Process

|Citizen|
start
:Citizen Login;
:Select Complaint;
:Enter Complaint Details;

|Smart City System|
:Validate Details;

if (Valid?) then (YES)
    |Citizen|
    :Submit Complaint;
else (NO)
    |Smart City System|
    :Show Error;
    stop
endif

|Smart City System|
:Save Complaint;

|Admin|
:Admin Reviews Complaint;
:Assign Department;

|Service Department|
:Department Processes Complaint;
:Resolve Complaint;
:Update Complaint Status;

|Smart City System|
:Notify Citizen;

|Citizen|
:Receive Notification;
stop

@enduml